${BOLD}TAG CATEGORIES${RESET}
    ${MAGENTA}Read-Only (Technical):${RESET}
        ENCODER, VIDEO_STREAM_HASH, AUDIO_STREAM_HASH, ATTACHMENTS

    ${MAGENTA}NMAAHC Standard Tags:${RESET}
